program	errors/use_after_move_loop_body_always_breaks.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	use of moved variable `body` across loop iterations
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: use of moved variable `body` across loop iterations"
log	"  --> examples/errors/use_after_move_loop_body_always_breaks.saw:35:30"
log	"     |"
log	" 35 |         let _ = consume_bool(move body)"
log	"     |                              ^"
log	"   hint: a binding moved inside a loop is moved-from on the next iteration; reassign it before the loop body ends, or move a fresh value"
log	""
log	"error: use of moved variable `head` across loop iterations"
log	"  --> examples/errors/use_after_move_loop_body_always_breaks.saw:47:24"
log	"     |"
log	" 47 |     while consume_bool(move head) {"
log	"     |                        ^"
log	"   hint: this move is in the loop's CONDITION, which re-evaluates on every iteration, so the second evaluation reads a binding the first one consumed; reassign it before the loop body ends, move a fresh value, or lift the move out of the loop"
log	""
log	"2 error(s) generated"
